 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K_fbLFrH7H8Q7kNvwEi93Kt&_nc_oc=Adr5kzn1rPud79iki0xTGqLsdLEoUFwN0xyTVJ7A3quXhH1DcAgzQJIIa7fLIiq8ZwQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJnXySUAs_JUiBqLu7SBjMHKRCJlR3RmKoyKhDlAafQmg&oe=6A998FC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nHxm9VdOVSMQ7kNvwFpoibS&_nc_oc=Adpe4NOcXYCYSlFdi8zrLjCtCyHOAtPOTDgomeZBnwgm0gTMuxVm4qAlgBWqqCwPpfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKrAlhze3mFg8chYlUGtoJZwH2RDHgKwJg54o73dfbGCg&oe=6A999D26"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uFmnHjkaERMQ7kNvwHCY1cx&_nc_oc=Adq03y3GAhdp3cVOdSD2qPh75WBbEHbc-vbKhb4mgbb9OqxaPnrHo1tV41stjfYbi5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLjk2mB34MNey4dSPJi-Y6a6gzh0wRtUKary9POQrEF7g&oe=6A996EDC"}, {"fil